k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>时间；左右；大约；临近</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ケイ・キョウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ころ・ごろ・しばら.く</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">頃</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ころ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">（大致的）时间；左右；前后；大约；合适的时候；时机；季节；时节；年月</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">近頃</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ちかごろ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">近来；最近；如今；非常；极其；很</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">手頃</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">てごろ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">便利；方便；顺手；合适；恰当；适度</span></li></ul></div></li>"]